The six skills under skills/ are rewrites for DeepSeek Harness of the upstream
vizro-e2e-flow skills (dashboard-design, dashboard-build, designing-vizro-layouts,
selecting-vizro-charts, wiring-vizro-actions, writing-vizro-yaml). They are
distributed here under the MIT license of this package; the upstream material
remains available under Apache-2.0.

Vizro itself is not bundled. The plugin installs it at run time with uv, pinned
to vizro==1.0.0, under the terms of its own license.
